7. In vercel.json, add a `headers` array with rules for `/assets/*` (long-lived immutable cache) and `/index.html` (no-cache). Example:
```json
"headers": [
  {
    "source": "/assets/(.*)",
    "headers": [{"key": "Cache-Control", "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"}]
  },
  {
    "source": "/index.html",
    "headers": [{"key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache"}]
  }
]
```
